[Script Info]
; Captions burned into hazel-probes-intro.mp4 (the Probes tutorial's intro video). Its voiceover
; (scripts/intro_voiceover.txt) speaks them in phrases, each of which may span several captions.
; To change the captions, edit the Dialogue lines below, then from the repo root run
;   python3 scripts/render_intro_captions.py      (needs ffmpeg and Pillow; writes a silent video)
;   scripts/render_intro_voiceover.py              (needs Kokoro; adds the voice; see its header)
; Positions: \pos is the center of the caption box. (938,272) sits right of the code, for captions 1 to 14;
; (938,530), from caption 15 (Auto Probe, 59.2 s) on, sits in the blank area beside the case rules.
; Times: each caption starts where its words begin in the voice track (scripts/intro_voiceover.txt).
Title: Hazel Probes intro captions
